{"content":[{"c":["KADMONITES"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Semitic tribe whose land was promised to Abraham’s descendants (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.15.19","r":"Gen.15.19","rawR":"Gen.15.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.15.19","value":"Gen.15.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 15:19"},"). The name of the tribe is the same as the Hebrew adjective “eastern” and suggests that references to peoples or lands of the east (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.6","r":"Gen.25.6","rawR":"Gen.25.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.6","value":"Gen.25.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.8.10","r":"Judg.8.10","rawR":"Judg.8.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.8.10","value":"Judg.8.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 8:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.4.30","r":"1Kgs.4.30","rawR":"1Kgs.4.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.4.30","value":"1Kgs.4.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 4:30"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Job.1.3","r":"Job.1.3","rawR":"Job.1.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.1.3","value":"Job.1.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jb 1:3"},") may be synonymous with the tribal name."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Kadmonites","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 15:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.15.19","rawQueryValue":"Gen.15.19","sourceRefExact":"Gen.15.19"},{"anchorText":"Gn 25:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.6","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.6","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.6"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 8:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.8.10","rawQueryValue":"Judg.8.10","sourceRefExact":"Judg.8.10"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 4:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.4.30","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.4.30","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.4.30"},{"anchorText":"Jb 1:3","canonicalization":"deferred_